    "created_at": "2017-04-27T15:19:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-27T15:19:28Z",
    "body": "AFAICT, the gbk tests differ from the spec for one code point to byte pair and vice versa mapping:\r\nThe tests want `A8` `BC` to decode to U+E7C7 and want U+E7C7 to encode to `A8` `BC`. However, per spec, `A8` `BC` maps to U+1E3F.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
